									"fragmentFields": [
										{
											"id": "element-html",
											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mr-5\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tHighlight\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p>Rebate Ninja centralizes agreements, claims, accruals, and settlements into one unified platform. It automates complex, multi-tier, volume-based, and conditional rebate programs while eliminating revenue leakage and improving collaboration across suppliers, distributors, and internal teams. With real-time analytics, AI-driven forecasting, and seamless ERP/CRM integration, it helps enterprises scale rebate operations with accuracy, control, and audit-ready compliance.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tFeatures\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><ul><li>Manage multi-tier, volume-based &amp; conditional rebate programs.</li><li>Digitized agreement creation with complete lifecycle tracking.</li><li>Real-time eligibility checks, accrual monitoring &amp; automated calculations.</li><li>Live dashboards with AI-based forecasting &amp; financial insights.</li><li>Custom reporting for finance, sales &amp; partner teams.</li><li>Native ERP/CRM connectors with secure, API-first integration.</li><li>Automated data sync to reduce manual effort.</li><li>Compliance-ready workflows with detailed audit trails.</li></ul><p><br></p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
													}
												}
											}
										}
									],
