										{
											"id": "element-html",
											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.catalog-icon {\n\t\twidth: 90px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 0\" class=\"catalog-icon mb-8\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/rebate-ninja-intelligent-rebate-management/001.svg$]\">\n\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\tAIMDek Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\n\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"company-description-container mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>AIMDek has been a trusted digital innovation partner since 2014, helping enterprises build scalable, integrated, and user-centric digital solutions. With strong engineering capabilities and industry knowledge, we enable organizations to modernize their operations and deliver better digital experiences.</p><p>For rebate and incentive management, AIMDek brings deep expertise in automating complex calculations, streamlining partner workflows, and improving data accuracy across programs. We help enterprises replace error-prone manual processes with intelligent, transparent, and compliant rebate systems that strengthen channel relationships and drive measurable revenue impact.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-white company-description-icons-container d-flex justify-content-between px-8 py-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/rebate-ninja-intelligent-rebate-management/006.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Website</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"https://www.aimdek.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twww.aimdek.com\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/rebate-ninja-intelligent-rebate-management/007.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Email</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"mailto:avakash.dekavadiya@aimdek.ca\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tavakash.dekavadiya@aimdek.ca\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/rebate-ninja-intelligent-rebate-management/008.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Phone</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"tel:91 7874788766\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t91 7874788766\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div></div>"
